o0x8070200a0 .functor BUFZ 8, c4<zzzzzzzz>; HiZ drive
v0x1056ec230_0 .net/s "b", 7 0, o0x8070200a0;  0 drivers
v0x1056ec2d0_0 .net/s "y", 8 0, L_0x1056ec550;  1 drivers
